{
  "description": "Phase 8 fix: `manifest --repo .` and `dirty --repo .` run from inside the config repo record absolute candidate paths (user_memory.json's files are absolute), so a later `drift --phase gather` accepts them instead of refusing 'is outside the config repo'.",
  "now": "2026-10-12T12:00:00Z",
  "git": [
    "repo"
  ],
  "write": {
    "repo/README.md": "# repo\n",
    "repo/memory/MEMORY.md": "# Memory\n",
    "repo/memory/topics/git.md": "# Memory\n\n## Feedback\n\n### Rel one\n\n**Why**: fixture.\n**How to apply**: fixture.\n**Source**: fixture | **Verified**: 2026-09-01\n",
    "repo/memory/.dream-state.json": "{\n  \"schema_version\": 3,\n  \"last_run\": \"2026-10-01T00:00:00Z\",\n  \"projects\": {\n    \"{ROOT}/proj/alpha\": {\n      \"last_analyzed\": \"2026-10-01T00:00:00Z\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"rejected_lessons\": [],\n  \"outcome_tags\": [],\n  \"episodic_ledger\": [],\n  \"cost_records\": [],\n  \"model_routing\": {},\n  \"deferred_sessions\": {},\n  \"quiet_sweeps\": {}\n}\n",
    "proj/alpha/AGENTS.md": "# alpha\n"
  },
  "manifest": [],
  "manifest_relative": true,
  "steps": [
    {
      "argv": [
        "dirty",
        "--repo",
        "."
      ],
      "cwd": "repo",
      "exit": 0,
      "files": {
        "sweep/dirty-at-orient.json": {
          "repo": "{ROOT}/repo",
          "candidates": {
            "{ROOT}/repo/memory/MEMORY.md": {
              "repo": "{ROOT}/repo",
              "git": "tracked"
            },
            "{ROOT}/repo/memory/topics/git.md": {
              "repo": "{ROOT}/repo",
              "git": "tracked"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "text_not_contains": {
        "sweep/dirty-at-orient.json": [
          "\"memory/",
          "\"memory\\\\"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "argv": [
        "drift",
        "--phase",
        "gather"
      ],
      "exit": 0,
      "stdout_not_contains": [
        "outside the config repo"
      ],
      "files": {
        "sweep/drift-gather.json": {
          "entries": []
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
